  "ingredients": [
    "2 chicken breast halves, boneless, skin-on",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste",
    "2 tablespoons olive oil",
    "8 ounces fresh mushrooms, sliced 1/4 inch thick",
    "1 pinch salt",
    "0.5 cup water",
    "1 tablespoon butter",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/O2HJZ_mRJYK3SGNHG2QzQ-JITFs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_221887_ChefJohnsChickenandMushrooms_Shot1_12982-93aa4dc237af408d9ae981788a97afbf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/221887/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Season chicken on all sides with salt and ground black pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat olive oil over medium-high heat in an ovenproof skillet. Place chicken skin-side down in skillet and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn chicken over; stir mushrooms with a pinch of salt into skillet. Increase heat to high; cook, stirring mushrooms occasionally, until mushrooms shrink slightly, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/btTb1ATvQ7WrOKIi3SMOLP9UnLA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_221887_ChefJohnsChickenandMushrooms_Shot3_13015-f6d1cea2687e41c1bb8e1a0cc6ffb8f9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/221887/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer skillet to the preheated oven and cook until chicken is no longer pink in the center and the juices run clear, 15 to 20 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read 165 degrees F (74 degrees C). Transfer chicken breasts to a plate and loosely tent with foil; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Set skillet on the stovetop over medium-high heat; cook and stir mushrooms until brown bits start to form on the bottom of the pan, about 5 minutes. Pour water into the skillet, and bring to a boil while scraping the browned bits off of the bottom of the pan. Cook until water is reduced by half, about 2 minutes. Remove from heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mtMbKxEKUTltADjxRAd2a3jrm78=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_221887_ChefJohnsChickenandMushrooms_Shot3_13022-7a2d9323345446a5b6323d4e7f7999bc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/221887/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in any accumulated juices from the chicken into the skillet. Stir butter into mushroom mixture, stirring constantly until butter is completely melted and incorporated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8kx7qHHxc2oLB2MjsmxPgm5m7xw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_221887_ChefJohnsChickenandMushrooms_Shot4_13025-287a9d99c23d45deb9d452894c434c3d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/221887/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season with salt and pepper. Spoon mushroom sauce over chicken and serve.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gLwqrL2oWu6XT1F20E0JaZQlY08=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_221887_ChefJohnsChickenandMushrooms_4x3_13064-7be7fa4467c546b1b680702ed36ec40d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/221887/step_09.webp"
    }
  ],
